1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,560
I find similar problems in other parts of their interface.

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:12,160
For example, walkflows needs more than a canvas that shows its depth.

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:20,120
Users also need to move to a different level, check node settings and note what they are

4
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,360
editing.

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:28,160
In the same way, knowledge space needs more than a graph of document links.

6
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:36,840
Users also need to manage documents and read their contents and understand how they fit

7
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,760
into the bigger knowledge structure.

